Z||000002||Ed||08-30-2001||01:08 AM||||BC-GT:<P>The weatherstrips were removed as part of the factory recalls.  They were removed to better ventilate the engine compartment.<P>If you still have yours, you may not have had the recalls (see archives for recall info), or someone has replaced it.<P>I put an original equipment strip back in my car.  Clipped right in. ||||reg||1
